  m_text: '

    Jail


    You can be sent directly to Jail by landing on the "Go to Jail" space. Rolling doubles three times in a row will send you to Jail. When in Jail, you can pay bail, roll for doubles to get out free, or use a "Get Out of Jail Free" card.'
