  m_text: Each player in the game takes turns rolling the dice and moving around the game board. If you roll the same number on both dice, you earn doubles and get to take another turn! If a player lands on an un-owned property, they can purchase it for themselves or put it up for auction, where all players can bid for it. When a player buys a property, it becomes theirs, and any other player that lands on it must pay rent to the owner.
